class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Burning_Icon_Big_a56686.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#27c429; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">115%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.9500\" title=\"Energy\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Energy <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Electrified Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Electrified_Icon_Big_b60abe.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:82.6087%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 17.3913%); display:inline-block;\">95%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Earth\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Earth <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poisoned Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_Big_f04eb1.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:86.9565%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 13.0435%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Drown\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Drown <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:86.9565%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 13.0435%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:86.9565%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 13.0435%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Horestis%20Tomb\">Horestis Tomb</a>, at the lowest level. After all the jars are broken, the wall of bones that usually blocks the west room will disappear, leading to a teleporter <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32942,32781,12\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32942, 32781, 12)</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tChases its opponent and summons <a href=\"#/wiki/Sandstone%20Scorpion\">Sandstone Scorpion</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tThere is a spot in the upper left portion of the room where only 2 creatures can attack you at a time. Throwing energy bombs on a large area can also make the fight more manageable for lower level characters, since creatures in the room will avoid them. Carrying a <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarven%20Ring\">Dwarven Ring</a> is advisable.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 51 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 50 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Scorpion Sceptre\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Scorpion_Sceptre_06e273.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></span></td>\n<td>Scorpion Sceptre</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1.0</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"100.000000\" style=\"text-align:center;\">100%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Coin_a5b511.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>9-243</td>\n<td>86.6</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"96.078431\" style=\"text-align:center;\">96%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\